WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:04.146
Unit two. Healthy Relationships and Communication!

2
00:00:05.073 --> 00:00:08.509
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:11.846
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.896 --> 00:00:16.414
Today we learn about Healthy Relationships and Communication. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:20.762
Communication. Say it with me. Communication!

6
00:00:24.326 --> 00:00:27.626
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

7
00:00:31.059 --> 00:00:34.342
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

8
00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:41.101
Boundary. Say it with me. Boundary!

9
00:00:44.584 --> 00:00:47.767
Listening. Say it with me. Listening!

10
00:00:51.285 --> 00:00:54.569
Honesty. Say it with me. Honesty!

11
00:00:58.029 --> 00:01:01.212
Support. Say it with me. Support!

12
00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:07.998
Friendship. Say it with me. Friendship!

13
00:01:11.536 --> 00:01:22.888
Healthy relationships are built on respect, trust, and honest communication. Setting a clear boundary and listening to others shows maturity. Good friendship offers support during difficult times.

14
00:01:22.938 --> 00:01:25.267
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.016 --> 00:01:31.042
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.092 --> 00:01:32.242
Trust!

17
00:01:33.066 --> 00:01:38.238
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.288 --> 00:01:39.438
Support!

19
00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:46.600
Did you know? Studies show that good listening skills are one of the top qualities people look for in a friend.

20
00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:48.400
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.114 --> 00:01:57.404
Think and answer. What makes a friendship or relationship feel healthy to you?

22
00:01:57.454 --> 00:01:58.604
Great answer!

23
00:01:59.697 --> 00:02:04.257
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
